// Grafting data, keyed by the taxon ids of the breeding tab (seeds/js/taxa.js).
// SCIONS[taxon id]: practice (standard | common | standards | occasional | not),
// how (grafting and propagation), cultivars (what differs between varieties),
// note (on a single cultivar), stocks (the rootstocks it is grafted on:
// {rs: rootstock id, compat: good | variable | interstock | poor, en, fr, src}).
// A taxon without data inherits the closest ancestor's practice.
// ROOTSTOCKS: id, name, aka, kind (clonal | seedling | species), parentage,
// traits per criterion ({level?, en, fr, src}). Texts are written in our own
// words from the cited pages; src items point at the place in the source.
// {{taxon-id}} links a plant, [[rootstock-id]] a rootstock.

